│ donors and the PBMCs and CD14-positive M/MΦs from chronic hepatitis B patients. Taken together, these results        │
│ demonstrate that HBsAg selectively inhibits Pam3csk4- stimulated IL-12 production in M/MΦs by blocking the JNK–MAPK  │
